  "diagnosisPeerReview": {
    "path": "context/reviews/tenant-snapshot-sql-performance/http-failure-diagnosis.json",
    "sha256": "bd40f34f127a880b50c381ad118e6ff5687b2ea67ad16374c563f5d5b0c6a65d",
    "verdict": "NO_BLOCKING_CAUSAL_OVERCLAIM_FOUND",
    "directEvidence": "LEASE_TIMEOUT and committed report-path trace are directly recorded. Timer callback, initiating blocker and request-to-PID lock assignment are not directly recorded.",
    "limits": "The10s operation-timer localization is a bounded reconstruction. Scenario-level contention supports a possible contributor but does not establish per-request lock wait or host cause. A failure does not show that B fixes reliability."
  },
  "conclusions": [
    "M shows lower complete tenant-snapshot latency in12/12 paired p50 comparisons and11/12 p95 comparisons on the frozen043/034 fixture, preserving1+24 fresh queries per call.",
    "H is fully recorded but failed:288 attempts include287 successful responses and one503. No blanket HTTP performance or reliability approval follows.",
    "C1 has all4 pairs and may be described diagnostically. dashboard-c4 has3 successful pairs; failed pair3 remains16 UNPAIRED attempts with no estimated paired effect.",
    "Reported cost fractions are computed per request from interval unions. Quantiles and percent-change medians are not additive; SQL/span/checkouts overlap and do not partition CPU.",
    "Pooled dashboard-C1 p95 worsened45.6899% (8764.8597ms A to12769.5164ms B), although its median paired p95 change is negative. These statistics answer different questions; the outlier and deterioration must both remain visible. With16 samples per arm, nearest-rank p95 equals the observed maximum."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "API server/driver wall time in a synthetic local fixture; no browser/UI rendering latency, production capacity or SLA result.",
    "Host was not reserved and external load was not controlled; small sample pair effects are observations, not isolated causal attribution or statistical significance.",
    "No claim about live workspace parallel25-to9 batching or044. Measured A/B differ by the pinned tenant SQL patch, with validation-only overlays declared.",
    "The first readiness FAIL is preserved and remains unclassified; the later explicit LEASE_TIMEOUT must not be projected backwards onto it.",
    "Source/dependency PASS and cleanup are present in the original evidence; this review checks evidence hashes/identities and does not rerun tree/dependency/Docker verification.",
    "17 analyzer findings remain unchanged; independent interpretation does not reclassify the campaign as VALID or PASS."
  ],
